The emergency call button
The lock screen includes an Emergency call button. It opens your phone's dialer. The app does not see the numbers you dial or the calls you make.
Sharing and selling
We do not sell, rent or share your information. The app has no advertising, analytics, crash-reporting or other tracking tools.
How long we keep information and how to delete it
Because everything is stored only on your phone, you are in control of it:
• Tap Remove next to a habit to delete that habit.
• Clear the app's storage in Android settings, or uninstall the app, to delete all habits, streaks and the downloaded AI model.
Security
Your data is kept in the app's private storage, which Android protects from other apps. Because we do not collect your data, there is nothing for us to lose or leak. No method of storing data is perfectly secure, so please also protect your phone with a screen lock.
Children
Whisky Hab is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from anyone. Since the app stores nothing outside the device, no child's information reaches us.
Not medical advice
Whisky Hab is a motivation tool. It does not provide medical advice and is not a treatment for any health condition. If you are trying to stop a habit that affects your health, please talk to a healthcare professional.
Changes to this policy
If we change this policy, we will update the date at the top and publish the new version at [URL where this policy is hosted]. If a change affects how your information is handled, we will tell you in the app.
